    "title" : "Avoid Unreachable Pattern Due to Previous Pattern",
    "description" : "Detects patterns in shell scripts that never match because a previous pattern already matches the input.",
    "explanation" : "## This pattern never matches because of a previous pattern.\n\nSee companion warning [[SC2221]].\n[Source](https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck/wiki/SC2222)",
