    "category" : "Compatibility",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid Using [[ ]] in POSIX sh",
    "description" : "Detects usage of [[ ]] test construct which is undefined in POSIX sh.",
    "explanation" : "## In POSIX sh, `[[ ]]` is undefined.\n\nPOSIX sh uses `[ ]` and `test` instead. To see the limitations/differences, view http://mywiki.wooledge.org/BashFAQ/031 \n[Source](https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck/wiki/SC3010)",
