    "title" : "Avoid Using `<file` Redirection in POSIX sh",
    "description" : "This rule detects usage of the `<file` redirection syntax which is undefined in POSIX sh.",
    "explanation" : "## In POSIX sh, `` `<file` `` is undefined.\nSee equivalent warning [[SC3034]]\n[Source](https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck/wiki/SC3035)",
